{% comment %}
  Section: Article de blog
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign comment_errors_id = 'CommentErrors-' | append: section.id
  assign comments_anchor = 'Comments-' | append: section.id
-%}

<article class="page-shell page-shell--narrow">
  <div class="page-shell__header">
    <time class="article__date" datetime="{{ article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">
      {{ 'blogs.article.posted_on' | t }} {{ article.published_at | date: format: 'date' }}
    </time>
    <h1 class="page-shell__title">{{ article.title | escape }}</h1>
    {%- if article.author != blank -%}
      <p class="article__author">{{ 'blogs.article.author' | t: author: article.author }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if article.image -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Image de tete : c'est l'element LCP de la page article, donc eager ET
      fetchpriority="high" (eager seul laisse le navigateur la mettre en file).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <img
      class="article__image"
      src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1500 }}"
      srcset="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ article.image | image_url: width: 1500 }} 1500w"
      sizes="(min-width: 990px) 800px, 100vw"
      alt="{{ article.image.alt | escape }}"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      width="{{ article.image.width }}"
      height="{{ article.image.height }}"
    >
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="rte article__content">{{ article.content }}</div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Blocs d'application : avis, partage, produits lies... deposes par le
    marchand dans l'editeur.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}
      <div class="article__app-block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        {% render block %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  <a href="{{ blog.url }}" class="article__back">
    {% render 'icon', icon: 'arrow-left' %}
    {{ 'blogs.article.back_to_blog' | t: title: blog.title }}
  </a>

  {%- comment -%}
    Commentaires. Rendus seulement si le blog les accepte : un blog sans
    commentaires n'affiche ni liste ni formulaire. Trois etats a traiter, sinon
    le lecteur ne sait pas ce qui s'est passe : publie, en attente de
    moderation, et en erreur.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if blog.comments_enabled? -%}
    <section class="article__comments" id="{{ comments_anchor }}" aria-labelledby="{{ comments_anchor }}-title">
      <h2 class="article__comments-title" id="{{ comments_anchor }}-title">
        {{ 'blogs.comments.title' | t: count: article.comments_count }}
      </h2>

      {%- if article.comments_count > 0 -%}
        {%- paginate article.comments by 20 -%}
          <ol class="article__comment-list" role="list">
            {%- for comment in article.comments -%}
              <li class="article__comment" id="Comment-{{ comment.id }}">
                <p class="article__comment-meta">
                  <span class="article__comment-author">{{ comment.author | escape }}</span>
                  <time datetime="{{ comment.created_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">
                    {{ comment.created_at | date: format: 'date' }}
                  </time>
                </p>
                <div class="article__comment-content rte">{{ comment.content }}</div>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ol>

          {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
            {% render 'pagination', paginate: paginate %}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endpaginate -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <p class="article__comments-empty">{{ 'blogs.comments.empty' | t }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- form 'new_comment', article, class: 'article__comment-form' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Blog modere : le commentaire n'apparait pas tout de suite. Le dire,
            sinon le visiteur croit que son envoi a echoue et recommence.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <p class="form__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            {%- if blog.moderated? -%}
              {{ 'blogs.comments.success_moderated' | t }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ 'blogs.comments.success' | t }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {% render 'form-errors', form: form, id: comment_errors_id %}

        <h3 class="article__comment-form-title">{{ 'blogs.comments.form_title' | t }}</h3>

        <label for="CommentAuthor-{{ section.id }}">
          {{ 'blogs.comments.author' | t }}
          <span class="form__required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span>
        </label>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CommentAuthor-{{ section.id }}"
          name="comment[author]"
          value="{{ form.author }}"
          autocomplete="name"
          required
          {%- if form.errors contains 'author' %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="{{ comment_errors_id }}"{% endif -%}
        >

        <label for="CommentEmail-{{ section.id }}">
          {{ 'blogs.comments.email' | t }}
          <span class="form__required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span>
        </label>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="CommentEmail-{{ section.id }}"
          name="comment[email]"
          value="{{ form.email }}"
          autocomplete="email"
          autocorrect="off"
          autocapitalize="off"
          required
          {%- if form.errors contains 'email' %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="{{ comment_errors_id }}"{% endif -%}
        >

        <label for="CommentBody-{{ section.id }}">
          {{ 'blogs.comments.message' | t }}
          <span class="form__required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span>
        </label>
        <textarea
          id="CommentBody-{{ section.id }}"
          name="comment[body]"
          rows="6"
          required
          {%- if form.errors contains 'body' %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="{{ comment_errors_id }}"{% endif -%}
        >{{ form.body }}</textarea>

        {% render 'required-note' %}

        {%- if blog.moderated? -%}
          <p class="article__comments-moderated">{{ 'blogs.comments.moderated_note' | t }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">{{ 'blogs.comments.submit' | t }}</button>
      {%- endform -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}
</article>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.main_article.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-main-article",
  "settings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@app"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
